    <h2>The 10-Inch Round: Dairy Queen's Definitive Party Centerpiece</h2>
  <p>When planning a birthday, graduation party, or family holiday, the 10-inch round DQ Cake is consistently the number-one choice across nationwide bakeries. Delivering 12 to 16 generous portions, it provides ample dessert without requiring the freezer footprint of a full commercial sheet cake. It also serves as the master canvas for DQ's premium Blizzard Cake creations—infusing chunks of Oreo, Reese's, or cookie dough directly into the soft serve layers. Explore all cake dimensions and seasonal variations across <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
